  "body": "## Summary\n- accept a creator-reviewed text-to-Persona contract during the prebirth gate\n- insert mapped Body evidence at the prompt placeholder without publishing private construction material\n- bound and validate prompt input, permit the larger structured response, and record the contract hash\n- document the workflow and preserve explicit user approval before Primer readiness or birth\n\n## Verification\n- 46 framework tests pass\n- Ruff passes\n- diff whitespace check passes\n\n## Trial result\nThe supplied optimized contract was exercised privately against the un-born pinned Hermes construction. It produced a much richer 2,871-word candidate, but the candidate remains unapproved because it overfit some sparse evidence and exhausted its completion allowance before the final required section. No Personality, Food credential, provider response, VCW data, or birth state is included in this pull request.",
